{"2022610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CRETE", "steam_appid": 2022610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not the end.</strong> It is one more step toward victory. Sharpen your bioengineered blades, ready your flesh-forged rifles, and deploy powerful tactical abilities. Humanity’s future depends on winning the war against the mysterious and ruthless <strong>Ancestors</strong>. Evolution is our only chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Parry! Counter-attack! Shred their armour and skin with your blade and expose something vital, then pull your gun to finish the job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRETE's combat doesn't forgive. Every mistake has a price. But when your reflexes and your choices finally click, victory becomes inevitable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUE COOPERATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can face CRETE alone, but you’ll experience its true potential together. Combine your attacks, protect each other, and find the tactics that only exist when several players think as one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the true meaning of teamwork. Share your defeats, own your victories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rip the genetic code from whatever stands in your way and weave it into your own. 9 Core Mutations and 99 Wild RNA that respond differently depending on where you socket them and how you combine them. Near-infinite combinations where no two runs ever look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not the end.</strong> It is one more step toward victory. Sharpen your bioengineered blades, ready your flesh-forged rifles, and deploy powerful tactical abilities. Humanity’s future depends on winning the war against the mysterious and ruthless <strong>Ancestors</strong>. Evolution is our only chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/8f49b4c77c57977cf8eed546cba0d2ef.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge! Parry! Counter-attack! Shred their armour and skin with your blade and expose something vital, then pull your gun to finish the job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRETE's combat doesn't forgive. Every mistake has a price. But when your reflexes and your choices finally click, victory becomes inevitable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRUE COOPERATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can face CRETE alone, but you’ll experience its true potential together. Combine your attacks, protect each other, and find the tactics that only exist when several players think as one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the true meaning of teamwork. Share your defeats, own your victories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/9eaccd1560507735579bdf711d9fa4cd.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rip the genetic code from whatever stands in your way and weave it into your own. 9 Core Mutations and 99 Wild RNA that respond differently depending on where you socket them and how you combine them. Near-infinite combinations where no two runs ever look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.poster.avif?t=1788125378\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.webm?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/extras/11eb4ef7b781f85d208b08713c04ee8a.mp4?t=1788125378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fight against the Ancestors and other biopunk creatures. Use their DNA to build your own procedural weapons, find a friend and combine your skills to be even more powerful. The further you go, the better rewards you will get for the next run. It is up to you to reveal what is up there in the north.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/14e3e05fd5ae4115d1ad5507e96905d302b823cf/header.jpg?t=1788125378", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/1816b237eef0f54bf2bca9550415342b4ead0ea7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788125378", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2022610/1816b237eef0f54bf2bca9550415342b4ead0ea7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788125378", "website": "https://www.cretegame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ 